#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:123
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "Constructors"

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:125
msgid ""
"Rather than building a model from scratch, you can also construct it for "
"certain predefined problems:"
msgstr ""
"En lloc de construir un model des de zero, també podeu construir-lo per a"
" certs problemes predefinits:"

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:127
msgid ""
":func:`Model.ising(edges, couplings, fields, "
"label)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.ising>` - Constructs an Ising problem for"
" a given weighted graph."
msgstr ""
":func:`Model.ising(edges, couplings, fields, "
"label)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.ising>` - Construeix un problema d'Ising "
"per a un graf amb pesos donat."

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:128
msgid ""
":func:`Model.knapsack(values, weights, max_weight, label, "
"lagrange_multiplier)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.knapsack>` - Constructs a "
"knapsack problem with given weights, values, and capacity."
msgstr ""
":func:`Model.knapsack(values, weights, max_weight, label, "
"lagrange_multiplier)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.knapsack>` - Construeix un "
"problema de la motxilla amb els pesos, valors i capacitat donats."

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:129
msgid ""
":func:`Model.max_cut(edges, weights, "
"label)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.max_cut>` - Constructs a max cut problem "
"for a given graph."
msgstr ""
":func:`Model.max_cut(edges, weights, "
"label)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.max_cut>` - Construeix un problema de "
"tall màxim per a un graf donat."

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:130
msgid ""
":func:`Model.graph_coloring(graph, num_colors, label, "
"lagrange_multiplier)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.graph_coloring>` - "
"Constructs a graph coloring problem for a given graph and number of "
"colors."
msgstr ""
":func:`Model.graph_coloring(graph, num_colors, label, "
"lagrange_multiplier)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.graph_coloring>` - "
"Construeix un problema de coloració de grafs per a un graf i un nombre de"
" colors donats."

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:131
msgid ""
":func:`Model.travelling_salesman(edges, distances, label, "
"lagrange_multiplier)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.travelling_salesman>` - "
"Constructs a travelling salesman problem for a given distance matrix."
msgstr ""
":func:`Model.travelling_salesman(edges, distances, label, "
"lagrange_multiplier)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.travelling_salesman>` - "
"Construeix un problema del viatjant de comerç per a una matriu de "
"distàncies donada."

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:132
msgid ""
":func:`Model.factoring(n, label)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.factoring>` - "
"Constructs a factoring problem for a given integer."
msgstr ""
":func:`Model.factoring(n, label)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.factoring>` - "
"Construeix un problema de factorització per a un enter donat."

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:134
msgid ""
"Each of these (except factoring) also has a random counterpart, useful "
"for generating problems for testing and benchmarking:"
msgstr ""
"Cadascun d'aquests (excepte la factorització) també té una contrapart "
"aleatòria, útil per generar problemes per a proves i avaluacions de "
"rendiment:"

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:137
msgid ""
":func:`Model.random_ising(num_variables, edge_probability, "
"coefficient_range, label, seed)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.random_ising>` -"
" Constructs a random Ising model, fully connected by default."
msgstr ""
":func:`Model.random_ising(num_variables, edge_probability, "
"coefficient_range, label, seed)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.random_ising>` -"
" Construeix un model d'Ising aleatori, completament connectat per "
"defecte."

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:138
msgid ""
":func:`Model.random_knapsack(num_items, value_range, weight_range, "
"capacity_ratio, label, seed, "
"lagrange_multiplier)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.random_knapsack>` - "
"Constructs a knapsack problem with random values and weights."
msgstr ""
":func:`Model.random_knapsack(num_items, value_range, weight_range, "
"capacity_ratio, label, seed, "
"lagrange_multiplier)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.random_knapsack>` - "
"Construeix un problema de la motxilla amb valors i pesos aleatoris."

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:139
msgid ""
":func:`Model.random_max_cut(num_nodes, edge_probability, weight_range, "
"label, seed)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.random_max_cut>` - Constructs a max"
" cut problem on a random connected graph."
msgstr ""
":func:`Model.random_max_cut(num_nodes, edge_probability, weight_range, "
"label, seed)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.random_max_cut>` - Construeix un "
"problema de tall màxim sobre un graf connex aleatori."

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:140
msgid ""
":func:`Model.random_graph_coloring(num_nodes, num_colors, "
"edge_probability, label, seed, "
"lagrange_multiplier)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.random_graph_coloring>` - "
"Constructs a graph coloring problem on a random connected graph."
msgstr ""
":func:`Model.random_graph_coloring(num_nodes, num_colors, "
"edge_probability, label, seed, "
"lagrange_multiplier)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.random_graph_coloring>` - "
"Construeix un problema de coloració de grafs sobre un graf connex "
"aleatori."

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:141
msgid ""
":func:`Model.random_travelling_salesman(num_cities, edge_probability, "
"distance_range, label, seed, "
"lagrange_multiplier)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.random_travelling_salesman>`"
" - Constructs a travelling salesman problem with random distances, on a "
"complete graph by default."
msgstr ""
":func:`Model.random_travelling_salesman(num_cities, edge_probability, "
"distance_range, label, seed, "
"lagrange_multiplier)<qilisdk.core.model.Model.random_travelling_salesman>`"
" - Construeix un problema del viatjant de comerç amb distàncies "
"aleatòries, sobre un graf complet per defecte."

