#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:156
msgid "Evaluating a Model"
msgstr "Avaluar un model"

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:158
msgid ""
"To evaluate a :class:`~qilisdk.core.model.Model`, provide values for all "
"involved variables:"
msgstr ""
"Per avaluar un :class:`~qilisdk.core.model.Model`, proporcioneu valors "
"per a totes les variables implicades:"

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:172
msgid ""
"The evaluation returns a dictionary with values for the objective and "
"constraints. A constraint returns `0.0` if satisfied, or its Lagrange "
"multiplier if violated."
msgstr ""
"L'avaluació retorna un diccionari amb valors per a l'objectiu i les "
"restriccions. Una restricció retorna `0.0` si es satisfà, o el seu "
"multiplicador de Lagrange si es viola."

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:175
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "Per exemple:"

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:191
msgid "Solving a Model Classically"
msgstr "Resoldre un model de manera clàssica"

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:193
msgid ""
"To help demonstrate the limits of classical solvers, a variety of "
"wrappers to different solvers are provided:"
msgstr ""
"Per ajudar a demostrar els límits dels resolutors clàssics, es "
"proporcionen diversos embolcalls per a diferents resolutors:"

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:195
msgid ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.brute_force_solver.BruteForceSolver`"
" - A brute-force solver that evaluates all possible solutions."
msgstr ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.brute_force_solver.BruteForceSolver`"
" - Un resolutor de força bruta que avalua totes les solucions possibles."

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:196
msgid ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.scipy_solver.ScipySolver` - A "
"solver that uses one of SciPy's `optimize` routines to find a solution."
msgstr ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.scipy_solver.ScipySolver` - Un "
"resolutor que utilitza una de les rutines `optimize` de SciPy per trobar "
"una solució."

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:197
msgid ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.simulated_annealing_solver.SimulatedAnnealingSolver`"
" - A simulated annealing solver, implemented entirely in C++. It requires"
" a QUBO, so a general model must be converted with "
":meth:`~qilisdk.core.model.Model.to_qubo` first."
msgstr ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.simulated_annealing_solver.SimulatedAnnealingSolver`"
" - Un resolutor de recuita simulada, implementat completament en C++. "
"Requereix un QUBO, per la qual cosa un model general s'ha de convertir "
"primer amb :meth:`~qilisdk.core.model.Model.to_qubo`."

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:198
msgid ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.scip_solver.ScipSolver` - A "
"wrapper to SCIP, a mixed-integer programming solver. This requires the "
"SCIP extra (i.e. ``pip install \"qilisdk[scip]\"``)."
msgstr ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.scip_solver.ScipSolver` - Un "
"embolcall per a SCIP, un resolutor de programació entera mixta. Això "
"requereix l'extra de SCIP (és a dir, ``pip install \"qilisdk[scip]\"``)."

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:200
msgid "These can be used as follows:"
msgstr "Es poden utilitzar de la manera següent:"

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:211
msgid ""
"Each of them returns a "
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.base_solver.ClassicalSolverResult`,"
" which exposes the solution found:"
msgstr ""
"Cadascun d'ells retorna un "
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.base_solver.ClassicalSolverResult`,"
" que exposa la solució trobada:"

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:214
msgid "``result.objective`` - the value of the model's objective at the solution"
msgstr "``result.objective`` - el valor de l'objectiu del model en la solució"

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:215
msgid ""
"``result.constraints`` - the value of each of the model's constraints, "
"keyed by label"
msgstr ""
"``result.constraints`` - el valor de cadascuna de les restriccions del "
"model, indexades per la seva etiqueta"

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:216
msgid ""
"``result.results`` - the objective and every constraint together, keyed "
"by label"
msgstr ""
"``result.results`` - l'objectiu i totes les restriccions juntes, indexats"
" per la seva etiqueta"

#: ../../modules/core/core_model.rst:217
msgid ""
"``result.sample`` - the value each of the model's variables takes in the "
"solution"
msgstr ""
"``result.sample`` - el valor que pren cadascuna de les variables del "
"model en la solució"

